  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre of Excellence for the RMG industry in Bangladesh (H&amp;M-ILO) - Centre of excellence</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre of Excellence f&#xf6;r teko-industrin i Bangladesh (H&amp;M-ILO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">H&amp;M, Sida and ILO aims to set up a Center for Excellence for skills   training in the Ready Made Garments (RMG) industry in Bangladesh.     With an industry based training focus, the project will serve as a    replicable model for meeting the skilled labour force need in the     sector as well as increase employability and higher incomes for the   working poor and therefore contribute to poverty alleviation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&amp;M, Sida och ILO &#xe4;mnar s&#xe4;tta upp ett s&#xe5; kallat Center of Excellence  f&#xf6;r yrkesutbildning inom teko-industrin i Bangladesh. Med ett         industribaserat tr&#xe4;nigsfokus, ska projektet s&#xe4;tta upp en replikerbar  modell f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;ta industrins behov av mer yrkeskunnig arbetskraft   samtidigt som anst&#xe4;llningsbarheten och l&#xf6;nerna f&#xf6;r de arbetande       fattiga kan h&#xf6;jas och d&#xe4;rmed leda till fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning.</narrative>
  </description>
